  "text": {
    "en": {
      "text": "Passively grants 20 Airborne Effectiveness to <primary/>Primary Weapons.\n\nGrants the following benefits while a <primary/>Primary Weapon is readied and not Aiming Down Sights:\n• 30 Mobility\n• 5 Range and 30? Stability\n• 70% decreased Accuracy Cone Size\n• 2 degrees increased Precision Aim Cone Angle\n• 20% increased Aim Assist and Damage Falloff Distance\n\n<exotic DMT />, <exotic Last Word />, and <exotic Tommy's Matchbook /> are uniquely tuned and do not receive as significant of a benefit.\n\n<primary/>Primary Weapon Kills grant Class Ability Energy based on <link Enemy Rank [#CombatantClassifications] />:\nMinors: 34% | Elites and higher: 100% | Players: 20%\n\n#ChunkEnergyUnaffected\n\nAt full Class Ability energy, scoring multiple <primary/>Primary Weapon Kills within 6 seconds of each grants an additional Class Ability Charge. Maximum of 2 extra charges.\n\nActivation progress granted by <link Enemy Rank [#CombatantClassifications] />:\nMinors: 34% | Elites and higher: 100% | Players: 100%",
      "updatedAt": "2026-01-03T22:30:36.024Z",
      "updatedBy": "Hawkmoona"
    }
  },
  "associated": [],
