      "plain": "Passively grants +20 Airborne Effectiveness to Primary Weapons.\n\nFor Primary Weapons while hipfiring:\n+30 Mobility, +30 Stability, +10 Aim Assist, +5% Auto Aim Cone Size\n-30% Accuracy Cone Size, -17% Accuracy Cone Growth,  +1.1° Precision Angle Threshold\n20% Increased Auto-Aim and Damage Falloff Distance\n50% Increased Magnetism Strength Distance\n DMT, Last Word, and Tommy's Matchbook only receive the Mobility and Stability bonuses. \n\nPrimary Weapon Kills grant Class Ability Energy.\nRank-And-File = 34% | Elite+ = 100% | Guardians = 20%\n\nUpon reaching 100% Counter Progress by scoring Primary Weapon Kills within 6 seconds of each while at Full Class Ability Energy: \nRank-And-File = 34% | Elite+ = 100% | Guardians = 100%\nGrants an additional Class Ability Charge, up to a maximum of 2 additional Class Ability Charges.",
